  "description": "<p>This high-quality area rug features a unique Bigfoot design, bringing a touch of outdoor adventure into your home. It's a perfect blend of personality and rustic charm, suitable for various living spaces.</p>\n<h3>Product Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Features a detailed Sasquatch design for a unique look.</li>\n<li>Offers durability and comfort with premium materials.</li>\n<li>Non-slip backing ensures safety.</li>\n<li>Soft surface provides a cozy feel underfoot.</li>\n<li>Designed for low maintenance and easy cleaning.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine-Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Living Room, Bedroom, Cabin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bigfoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Bigfoot, Sasquatch, Outdoor Adventure, Nature, Wildlife</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Rustic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h3>Material &amp; Care</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Regular vacuuming or gentle washing</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h3>Where It Works</h3>\n<p>This area rug is an excellent choice for adding rustic charm to your living room, bedroom, or cabin. It's ideal for those who appreciate the beauty of the forest and wildlife.</p>",
